msgid ""
"Connect the sensor's GND and TX pin to one of the autopilot's serial ports. "
"Note that the TX pin of the sensor should be connected to the RX pin of the "
"autopilot. In the image above the sensor is connected to the Telem2 port."
msgstr ""
"将传感器的 GND 和 TX 引脚连接到飞控的某个串口。注意传感器的 TX 引脚应接到飞控的 RX 引脚。上图中传感器连接在 Telem2 口。"

