msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.02（UP-T101-Plus 设为 0.02，UP-T201 设为 "
"0.05）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-tx-series.rst:52
#: 2a87f394e527481ba0fd4a3316155ec2 52026fa759e24b63aa81deffcafbcf04
#: 6c001ae8ca88498fbc25618ea6ec90b0
msgid ""
"Once the sensor is activated, you should be able to observe the optical flow"
" and distance sensor data on the Status page of the task planner. "
"\"opt_m_x\", \"opt_m_y\", \"opt_qua\" and \"rangefinder1\" data have been "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"传感器激活后，即可在任务规划器的 Status 页面上观察到光流和距离传感器数据。\"opt_m_x\"、\"opt_m_y\"、\"opt_qua\""
" 和 \"rangefinder1\" 数据会随之更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-tx-series.rst:55
#: 21b4b8a0f5064896ae93881b122a897c 612b288bc068478b920c18c930e9b393
#: af13ca6cf7074d51b385e9361214d3f6
