msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-tx-series.rst:57
#: 2c456c8c3d5f4ad486781c90b8e26226 6c77f04cb0be4b949273b7b419c851de
#: f42fa4451bf14f489a6651dcd415f292
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-upixels-tx-series.rst:58
#: 216ab7c3ec584ab3aaed08799cb079db c847671bd4c243ba83dbe817bcab943c
#: ca4537a8f6594257b05e025d1095a6b8
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

